<title>UK: Hoogovens sets 200 million guilder eight-year bond.</title>
<headline>Hoogovens sets 200 million guilder eight-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Rabobank Nederland.</p>
<p> BORROWER   Royal Hoogovens</p>
<p> AMT    200 MLN DFL   COUPON     6.75	MATURITY    18.OCT.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.60    PAY DATE    18.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	REOFFER    99.975    SPREAD	+19 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    AMSTERDAM PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 5-10	SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    DUTCH     HOME CTRY  NETHS     TAX PROVS   DOMESTIC</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.375     SELL CONC  1.625     PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
